{"id":"n64524-2-9","stage":1,"title":"넘다 · 越过","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64524-2-9-1","ko":"집까지 아직 한참 더 가야 돼요?","zh":"还要再走很久才能到家吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집까지","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한참","meaning":"一阵，好一阵，好一会，老半天，大半天","explanation":"한참：一阵，好一阵，好一会，老半天，大半天","readings":[{"term":"한참","audio":"/audio/7c9ab81e35e5793d4f35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72463","senseId":"1","lemma":"한참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가야","meaning":"走","explanation":"가다：走；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"13","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요?","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"7c9ab81e35e5793d","term":"한참","zh":"一阵，好一阵，好一会，老半天，大半天","audio":"/audio/7c9ab81e35e5793d4f35.mp3","entryId":"72463","definition":"时间过了很久。","pronunciation":["한참"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"走","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"通过某种途径移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/474516bbbf69de4529fc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64524-2-9-2","ko":"저 언덕만 넘으면 돼.","zh":"只要翻过那座小山就到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언덕만","meaning":"坡，丘陵，山坡，山丘","explanation":"언덕：坡，丘陵，山坡，山丘；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"언덕","audio":"/audio/ddef881d90afab872b8f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15097","senseId":"1","lemma":"언덕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넘으면","meaning":"越过","explanation":"넘다：越过；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"넘다","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64524","senseId":"2","lemma":"넘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]